[00:21.86]星[ほし]をみる少女[しょうじょ] 雨[あめ]に濡[ぬ]れている
[>en]The stargazing girl stands drenched in the rain.
[>ja-Latn]Hoshi wo miru shoujo ame ni nurete iru
[00:27.01]あれは流星群[りゅうせいぐん]の前[まえ]の日[ひ] 夢[ゆめ]が叶[かな]うからって
[>en]It’s the eve of the meteor shower, when dreams are supposed to come true.
[>ja-Latn]Are wa ryuuseigun no mae no hi yume ga kanau kara tte
[00:32.35]教[おし]えてもらった小[ちい]さな閃[ひらめ]き
[>en]I was given a tiny spark of inspiration,
[>ja-Latn]Oshiete moratta chiisana hirameki
[00:38.95]雨合羽[あまがっぱ]なんか着[き]てどこにいくの？
[>en]where are you heading off to in that raincoat?
[>ja-Latn]Amagappa nanka kite doko ni iku no?
[00:43.73]こんな雨[あめ]じゃ（こんな星[ほし]が）何[なに]も見[み]えない（何[なに]も見[み]えない）
[>en]In this heavy rain (in this heavy rain), we can’t see anything at all (we can’t see anything).
[>ja-Latn]Konna ame ja (konna hoshi ga) nani mo mienai (nani mo mienai)
[00:50.78](Stargazing)
[>en](Stargazing.)
[>ja-Latn](Stargazing)
[00:56.64]Stargazing 星[ほし]をみる少女[しょうじょ]
[>en]Stargazing, oh stargazing girl,
[>ja-Latn]Stargazing hoshi wo miru shoujo
[01:01.79]幼気[いたいけ]なあなたの瞳[ひとみ]に
[>en]deep within your innocent eyes,
[>ja-Latn]Itaike na anata no hitomi ni
[01:07.02]Stargazing まだ映[うつ]ってますか
[>en]stargazing, are those stars still reflecting?
[>ja-Latn]Stargazing mada utsuttemasu ka
[01:12.45]胸[むね]を張[は]って会[あ]いに行[い]けるように 今[いま]
[>en]I want to hold my head high when I go to meet you now.
[>ja-Latn]Mune wo hatte ai ni ikeru you ni ima
[01:21.68]（うねる空[そら]が裂[さ]けて）
[>en](The swirling sky parts,)
[>ja-Latn](Uneru sora ga sakete)
[01:26.65]（一筋[ひとすじ]の閃光[せんこう]が）
[>en](and a single flash of light)
[>ja-Latn](Hitosuji no senkou ga)
[01:32.93]映[うつ]った (stargazing)
[>en]is reflected. (Stargazing.)
[>ja-Latn]Utsutta (stargazing)
[01:39.93](Stargazing)
[>en](Stargazing.)
[>ja-Latn](Stargazing)
[01:44.98]星[ほし]をみる少女[しょうじょ] すぐに走[はし]り出[だ]す
[>en]The stargazing girl breaks into a run immediately,
[>ja-Latn]Hoshi wo miru shoujo sugu ni hashiridasu
[01:50.05]しなる防風林[ぼうふうりん]と街並[まちな]み そういえばそうだった
[>en]passing the bending trees and the city streets – yes, that’s how it was.
[>ja-Latn]Shinaru boufuurin to machinami sou ieba sou datta
[01:55.45]忘[わす]れてしまった小[ちい]さな時間[じかん]を
[>en]Though I try to recall those forgotten moments,
[>ja-Latn]Wasurete shimatta chiisana jikan wo
[02:02.07]思[おも]い出[だ]してみて もう二度[にど]とは
[>en]I know that we can never return to them.
[>ja-Latn]Omoidashite mite mou nido to wa
[02:06.72]戻[もど]れないと（戻[もど]れないと）そう思[おも]うから（そう思[おも]うから）
[>en]Since we can never go back (can never go back), that’s what I believe (that’s what I believe).
[>ja-Latn]Modorenai to (modorenai to) sou omou kara (sou omou kara)
[02:13.61](Stargazing)
[>en](Stargazing.)
[>ja-Latn](Stargazing)
[02:19.62]Stargazing 夢[ゆめ]をみる少女[しょうじょ]
[>en]Since we can never go back (can never go back), that’s what I believe (that’s what I believe).
[>ja-Latn]Stargazing yume wo miru shoujo
[02:24.94]完璧[かんぺき]な未来[みらい]など無[な]いけど
[>en](Stargazing.)
[>ja-Latn]Kanpeki na mirai nado nai kedo
[02:30.16]Stargazing 約束[やくそく]をしよう
[>en]Stargazing, let's make a promise
[>ja-Latn]Stargazing yakusoku wo shiou
[02:35.52]胸[むね]を張[は]って会[あ]いに来[こ]れるように
[>en]So that you can come see me with pride
[>ja-Latn]Mune wo hatte ai ni koreru you ni
[02:39.82]そうだ あの日[ひ]追[お]いかけたほうき星[ぼし]が 立ち止[たど]まった私[わたし]の前[まえ]に
[>en]Yes, the comet we chased that day came to a stop right before my eyes.
[>ja-Latn]Sou da ano hi oikaketa houkiboshi ga tachidomatta watashi no mae ni
[02:46.33]くるくる回[まわ]ったビー玉[だま]みたいな渦[うず]を纏[まと]い立[た]った
[>en]It stood there, wrapped in a swirling pattern like a spinning marble.
[>ja-Latn]Kurukuru mawatta biidama mitai na uzu wo matoi tatta
[02:50.91]そうだ 追[お]いかけながら指切[ゆびき]りした 何[なに]も言[い]わないで
[>en]Yes, we made a pinky promise while chasing it, without saying a word.
[>ja-Latn]Sou da oikake nagara yubikiri shita nani mo iwanaide
[03:01.27](Stargazing 星[ほし]をみる少女[しょうじょ])
[>en]Yes, the comet we chased that day came to a stop right before my eyes.
[>ja-Latn](Stargazing hoshi wo miru shoujo)
[03:06.52]会[あ]いたくてここまで来[き]たんだろう
[>en]It stood there, wrapped in a swirling pattern like a spinning marble.
[>ja-Latn]Aitakute koko made kita ndarou
[03:11.53]Stargazing まだ覚[おぼ]えてますか
[>en]Yes, we made a pinky promise while chasing it, without saying a word.
[>ja-Latn]Stargazing mada meboetemasu ka
[03:17.43]私[わたし]たちは無限[むげん]じゃないけど 恋[こい]のような眼[め]してみたから
[>en]We aren't infinite, but because we looked with eyes full of love
[>ja-Latn]Watashitachi wa mugen janai kedo koi no you na me de mita kara
[03:22.78]ここまで歩[ある]いて来[こ]れたのさ
[>en]We’ve walked this far.
[>ja-Latn]Koko made aruite koreta no sa
